Package: CompFinanceR
Type: Package
Title: Computational Finance Tools in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lech", "Grzelak", email = "lech.grzelak@example.com", role = c("aut")),
    person("Repository", "Contributor", email = "contributor@example.com", role = c("cre", "aut"))
    )
Description: A comprehensive R package for computational finance, providing tools for
    simulating stochastic processes (GBM, Heston, CIR, Merton, Bates), pricing options
    (European, Asian, Barrier, Digital, Forward Start), computing Greeks, and implementing
    hedging strategies. All functions follow tidyverse design principles with comprehensive
    documentation and examples.
